{
    "title": "The Book of Mormon",
    "description": "Another Testament of Jesus Christ. The Book of Mormon is the word of God, like the Bible. Both books contain God's guidance as revealed to prophets, as well as religious histories of different civilizations. While the Bible is written by and about the people in the land of Israel and surrounding areas and takes place from the creation of the world until shortly after the death of Jesus Christ, the Book of Mormon contains the history of God's dealings with the people who lived in the Americas between approximately 600 BC and 400 AD. The Book of Mormon is another testament of Jesus Christ. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Learn about Jesus Christ in your heart language (100+ languages available)\r\n\u2022 Listen anywhere with downloadable audio narration in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and other languages \r\n\u2022 Be inspired and reminded daily with scripture notifications\r\n\u2022 Become more familiar with the Book of Mormon by exploring the Discover section\r\n\u2022 See the Book of Mormon come to life with dramatized accounts in the Videos section",
